# MathTime Professional 2 (optional maths fonts): licensed to you alone. The originals, the zips and
# everything tools/mtpro2_unicode.py writes into Fonts/ must never be committed. See Fonts/README.md.
*mtp2*/
*mtpro2*/
*mtp2*.zip
*mtpro2*.zip
*.pfb
*.pfm
*.afm
*.tfm
*.vf
*.otf
*.ttf
mtpro2.sty
mtpro2.map
mtpro2-glyphtounicode.tex
umt2*.fd
omslbm.fd
EULA-MTPro2*
# the OpenType conversion (mtpro2_otf.py): the fonts and its generated package, which holds metrics
# and macros taken from mtpro2.sty
MTPro2Math*
mtpro2-otf*
*mtpro2-otf-build*
Fonts/*
!Fonts/README.md
__pycache__/
# the converter and its table hold no font data: keep them
!tools/mtpro2_unicode.py
!tools/mtpro2_unicode_map.json
!tools/mtpro2_otf.py

